### Important Dates 2018 and 2019

We have brand new courses starting on Tuesday October 2nd for both beginners drumming and dancing classes. Here are a few other important dates to pop into your diary for the rest of the year. **October 2nd - October 23rd 2018** New 4 week Course in African drumming and African dancing **October 7th 2018** Camp Afro Foli early bird tickets expire tonight [Book Now](/product/camp-afro-foli-full-camp/) **October 30th, November 13th, November 20th, November 27th 2018** New 4 week course in African drumming and African dancing **December 1st 2018** Rhythm Culture XMAS Party on Bribie Island. Performance and African Feast with International guest artists. [Book Here](/product/camp-afro-foli-african-feast-show/)  **December 1st - December 3rd 2018** Camp Afro Foli Drum & Dance Summer Retreat [Learn More](/camp-afro-foli-drum-dance-retreat/) **December 4th, December 11th, December 18th 2018** New 3 week course in African Drumming and Dancing **January 12th 2019** Rhythm Culture Drum & Dance Launch 11am-5pm **January 29th 2019** Rhythm Culture drum and dance courses begin for 201
